An adjacent application may execute Aedicule's `run` script while retaining its
own working directory. The launcher must resolve its flake path and Cargo
manifest from `BASH_SOURCE[0]`, then pass both as absolute paths without
changing the caller's CWD. `tests/cli/launcher_cwd` uses a fake `nix` to
classify the complete argument vector and the observed CWD, so a future wrapper
edit cannot silently fall back to the application checkout.
